  "title": "Registration For The Swiss Research Data Day",
  "language": "en",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "heading": "Main article",
      "text": "Registration for the Swiss Research Data Day 2018 (SRDD2018) is now open. #SRDD2018 will gather notable speakers to discuss practices around handling, managing, and sharing research data. In addition, you can showcase your own work as a poster and network with colleagues.\n\nAs a project partner in DLCM (Digital Lifecycle Management) ETH Library's Digital Curation Office supports this event in terms of content and organization."
    }
